- Graphiti (graphiti-core 0.31.2) — https://github.com/getzep/graphiti — Apache License 2.0.
  Used unmodified as a dependency (temporal knowledge graph, hybrid search).
- persona_vectors — https://github.com/safety-research/persona_vectors (commit b8e0f04) — Apache License 2.0.
  The method (and any adapted code, marked in file headers) is used in packages/persona-lab.
  Reference: Chen et al., "Persona Vectors: Monitoring and Controlling Character Traits in Language Models", 2025.

Honcho (https://github.com/plastic-labs/honcho, AGPL-3.0) was studied at the level of public behavior and
high-level architecture only. No Honcho source code is included in or distributed with Memory Mesh.

